---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — UAE Gratuity Calculator';
const description =
  'Privacy Policy for UAE Gratuity Calculator. Learn how we handle your data — no personal data is stored, calculations run locally in your browser.';

const lastUpdated = 'June 2025';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://uaegratuitycalculator.com/privacy-policy">
  <section class="bg-canvas py-12 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-mute uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">LEGAL</p>
      <h1 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-1.5px] text-ink mb-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-mute mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-[16px] text-body leading-[1.75]">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">Overview</h2>
          <p>
            UAE Gratuity Calculator (<strong class="text-ink font-medium">uaegratuitycalculator.com</strong>) is designed to respect your privacy. The core calculator runs entirely in your browser — no salary figures, dates, or personal information are transmitted to or stored on our servers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">1. Information we do not collect</h2>
          <p>We do not collect, store, or process:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-mute">
            <li>Salary amounts entered into the calculator</li>
            <li>Employment dates (join date, last working date)</li>
            <li>Contract type or reason for leaving</li>
            <li>Unpaid leave days</li>
            <li>Calculated gratuity results</li>
            <li>Names, email addresses, or any personally identifiable information (unless you contact us directly)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">2. Information we may collect automatically</h2>
          <p>
            Like most websites, our hosting provider may collect standard server logs, which can include:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-disc marker:text-mute">
            <li>IP address (anonymised or truncated where possible)</li>
            <li>Browser type and version</li>
            <li>Operating system</li>
            <li>Pages visited and timestamps</li>
            <li>Referring URL</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This data is used solely for security monitoring, uptime analysis, and aggregate traffic statistics. It is not linked to any personal profile and is not sold to third parties.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">3. Google Translate</h2>
          <p>
            This site offers optional page translation powered by Google Translate. If you use the language selector, your browser communicates with Google's servers. Google's handling of data in this context is governed by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-link hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>. We do not control or have access to any data processed by Google Translate.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Translation is entirely optional. The calculator works fully in English without activating Google Translate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">4. Cookies and local storage</h2>
          <p>
            We use browser <strong class="text-ink font-medium">localStorage</strong> to remember your dark/light mode preference. This is a single key (<code class="text-[14px] font-mono bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">theme</code>) stored locally on your device. It is not transmitted to any server and contains no personal information.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Google Translate sets a cookie (<code class="text-[14px] font-mono bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">googtrans</code>) when you select a language. This cookie is used to persist your language preference. It is removed when you reset to English.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not use advertising cookies, tracking pixels, or analytics cookies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">5. Contact information</h2>
          <p>
            If you contact us via the <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline">contact page</a> or directly by email, we will receive your name, email address, and the content of your message. This information is used solely to respond to your enquiry and is not shared with third parties.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">6. Third-party links</h2>
          <p>
            This site may contain links to external resources (such as MOHRE, UAE labour law documents, or legal references). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those external sites.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">7. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            This tool is intended for working adults. We do not knowingly collect any information from individuals under 18 years of age.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3 tracking-[-0.4px]">9. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this Privacy Policy? Reach us via the <a href="/contact" class="text-link hover:underline">contact page</a> or at <a href="mailto:hello@uaegratuitycalculator.com" class="text-link hover:underline font-mono text-[14px]">hello@uaegratuitycalculator.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 16l-4-4m0 0l4-4m-4 4h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to calculator
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
